      "number": 20,
      "answer": "(1) $-8$ (2) $-1$ (3) $7$",
      "solution": "(1) 양변에 $1$을 대입하면,\n$(1-2-1)^{3}=a_{0}+a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+a_{4}+a_{5}+a_{6}$\n$-8=a_{0}+a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+a_{4}+a_{5}+a_{6}$ ⋯ ㉠\n$\\therefore a_{0}+a_{1}+a_{2}+a_{3}+a_{4}+a_{5}+a_{6}=-8$\n(2) 양변에 $2$를 대입하면,\n$(4-4-1)^{3}=a_{0}+2a_{1}+4a_{2}+8a_{3}+16a_{4}+32a_{5}+64a_{6}$\n$-1=a_{0}+2a_{1}+4a_{2}+8a_{3}+16a_{4}+32a_{5}+64a_{6}$ ⋯ ㉡\n$\\therefore a_{0}+2a_{1}+4a_{2}+8a_{3}+16a_{4}+32a_{5}+64a_{6}=-1$\n(3) ㉡에서 ㉠을 빼면\n$-1-(-8)=a_{1}+3a_{2}+7a_{3}+15a_{4}+31a_{5}+63a_{6}$\n$\\therefore a_{1}+3a_{2}+7a_{3}+15a_{4}+31a_{5}+63a_{6}=7$",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "answer": "(1) $a=-10$, $b=10$ (2) $-10$",
      "solution": "(1) (가)조건에 의해 $P(1)=1$,\n(나)조건에 의해 $P(2)=-2$\n$P(x)$를 $A(x)$로 나누었을 때 몫을 $B(x)$라 하면\n$P(x)=A(x)B(x)+x^{3}+ax+b$\n$=(x-1)(x-2)\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)B(x)+x^{3}+ax+b$\n$P(1)=1+a+b=1$ ⋯ ㉠\n$P(2)=8+2a+b=-2$ ⋯ ㉡\n㉡$-$㉠을 하면 $\\therefore a=-10$\n㉠에 $a=-10$을 넣으면 $\\therefore b=10$\n(2) (1)에서 나온 식에 의해\n$P(x)=(x-1)(x-2)\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)B(x)+x^{3}-10x+10$\n$=\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)\\{(x-1)(x-2)B(x)\\}+x^{3}-10x+10$\n$=\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)\\{(x-1)(x-2)B(x)\\}+\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)(x-2)-8x+14$\n$=\\left(x^{2}+2x+2\\right)\\{(x-1)(x-2)B(x)+(x-2)\\}-8x+14$\n따라서 $Q(x)=(x-1)(x-2)B(x)+(x-2)$\n$R(x)=-8x+14$\n$Q(2)=0$, $R(3)=-10$\n$\\therefore Q(2)+R(3)=-10$",
